Apache License 2.0  (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt) - code meant to run on devices or in the
manufacturer's own build pipeline, so it can be embedded in closed firmware without obligations:
  - firmware/                  (ESP32 reference agent)
  - fleetproof/agent.py        (reference device agent)
  - fleetproof/crypto.py       (signing and request-authentication helpers)
  - fleetproof/publisher.py    (release signing tool, runs in CI)

